    <item id="benefits">
        <header data-class="padding-bottom-md">
            <title>What can I do with the Security Cloud Control Firewall Manager API?</title>
        </header>
        <cards data-class="has-border font-weight-lighter" data-columns="3">
            <card>
                <icon>
                    <img data-src="/images/2020-branch-offices-icon.svg" />
                </icon>
                <title data-class="font-weight-lighter">Inventory and Deployment</title>
                <description data-color="#39393b">Onboard and manage devices, services, and device managers, then deploy configuration changes across your entire fleet. Track long-running operations with the transaction API.</description>
            </card>
            <card>
                <icon>
                    <img data-src="/images/search.png" />
                </icon>
                <title data-class="font-weight-lighter">Policy, Objects, and Monitoring</title>
                <description data-color="#39393b">Manage firewall policy objects, run complex searches across your tenant, execute commands fleet-wide, and monitor RA VPN sessions, MFA events, and your changelog.</description>
            </card>
	           <card>
		          <icon>
                    <img data-src="/images/2020-security-visibility-icon-2.svg" />
                </icon>
                <title data-class="font-weight-lighter">Automation Tools and AI Agents</title>
                <description data-color="#39393b">Skip writing your own HTTP client. Use our Python SDK, CLI, Ansible collection, Terraform provider, or the agent plugin for Claude Code and Codex.</description>
            </card>
        </cards>
    </item>



